            <ArticleTitle>[Action of fengsuidan granules on experimental anti-oral ulcer].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>303-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="OBJECTIVE" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">To explore the anti-oral ulcer action, anti-inflammatory and analgesic effect of Fengsuidan Granules(FSDG).</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="METHODS" NlmCategory="METHODS">FSDG(0.5, 5.0, 10.0 g.kg-1) were administered to experimental animals. The oral ulcer in experimental animals was effected by means of white staphylococcus (sc) and carbolic acid (buming).</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="RESULTS" NlmCategory="RESULTS">Such as acetic acid body turning, hot-plate, auricle inflammation by dimethylbenzene and foot swelling by egg white were used.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSION" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">Following certain regularities of dose-effect relationship, FSDG has anti-oral ulcer effect, helps reduce and heal the ulcer and works efficaciously in analgesic and anti-inflammatory cases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
